    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "アイネスフウジン",
            "enName": "Ines Fujin",
            "jpText": "はぁ……大事な勝負だったのに\r\n逃げ切れなかったの～。",
            "enText": "<i>Sigh…</i> It was such an important opportunity.\nI can't believe I couldn't stay in front.",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": 8827146481492964605,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アイネスフウジン",
            "enName": "Ines Fujin",
            "jpText": "やっぱり、ライバルによっては差したり\r\n追い込んだりも考えなきゃダメなのかな……？",
            "enText": "I wonder… Should I come up with a strategy\nfor when my opponents surge ahead late or\nchase me down at the very end…?",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": -5237233290220645412,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ツインターボ",
            "enName": "Twin Turbo",
            "jpText": "えーーーーっ！？",
            "enText": "Whaaaat?!",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": 336915851454208485,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ツインターボ",
            "enName": "Twin Turbo",
            "jpText": "次はもっといっぱい逃げればいいじゃん！\r\n勝負はいつでもターボ全開じゃなきゃ～！！",
            "enText": "Just outrun them even more next time!\nGoing full turbo's always the way to do it!!",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": -2974811972809290203,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "サイレンススズカ",
            "enName": "Silence Suzuka",
            "jpText": "私もそう思う。",
            "enText": "I'd have to agree.",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": 8411554644521919931,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "サイレンススズカ",
            "enName": "Silence Suzuka",
            "jpText": "先頭の景色は誰にも譲りたくない……。\r\nアイネス先輩は、違いますか？",
            "enText": "I never want to give up the view from the very\nfront… Is it different for you, Ines?",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": 1669980810809790644,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アイネスフウジン",
            "enName": "Ines Fujin",
            "jpText": "……違わない。\r\nあたし、逃げ切りたい……！",
            "enText": "No, you're right… I want to stay ahead\nof the pack too!",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": 1580173393531379218,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アイネスフウジン",
            "enName": "Ines Fujin",
            "jpText": "ありがと、2人とも！\r\nあたし、次もがんばってみるのっ！",
            "enText": "Thanks, you two! I feel like I can try\neven harder now!",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": -2660560103475134060,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アイネスフウジン",
            "enName": "Ines Fujin",
            "jpText": "よーし！\r\n今度の子ども服セールは負けないのー！",
            "enText": "Yeah! There's no way I'll miss out\nat the next kids' clothing sale!",
            "nextBlock": 10,
